lca_confbus_probe -- binary=/tmp/gxlca/gxemul label=M9_null machine=alphabook1
row            got                      want                     note                                                 
bus ctl        absent                   yes                      CONTROL: identical read at ioc_conf==0 completed and printed FAIL
bus ctlsig     absent                   0xffffffffffffffff       DEVICE SIGNATURE: empty-slot ID probe; unmapped would read 0 FAIL
bus kill       dead                     alive                    an ACCEPTED stq 0x1 then an ordinary ldq must NOT end the host FAIL
bus attrib     died-elsewhere           yes                      ATTRIBUTION: a death here must carry THIS arm's unique diagnostic FAIL
t1 alive       dead                     alive                    a type-1 write to a NON-zero bus must not end the host FAIL
t1 anchor      no                       yes                      ANCHOR: forwarding happened AND landed at bus 1 dev 3 func 2 FAIL
t1 alias       died                     refused                  type-1 with bus 0 must NOT be forwarded (checkpointed by the later anchor store) FAIL
t1 rdval       died                     0xffffffffffffffff       the refusal must synthesise the empty-slot signature at register 0 FAIL
t1 dev7rd      died                     0xffffffffffffffff       MISROUTING: a refused alias must NOT return 0:7:0's real config data FAIL
t1 dev7wr      died                     refused                  MISROUTING: a refused alias WRITE must not reach 0:7:0 either FAIL
t0 write       died                     yes                      the type-0 WRITE cell: a write must still reach bus_pci and name its slot FAIL
t0 alive       dead                     alive                    ACCEPT: the type-0 path must still reach a registered device FAIL
t0 real        absent                   real                     ACCEPT: dev 7 is the i82378zb -- neither empty-slot nor unmapped FAIL
t0 accept      absent                   0x304848086              ACCEPT: the exact value type-0 service returned before the fix FAIL

LCACONFBUS_T1ANCHOR=no
